// purpose: Detecting M365 Copilot Shared Agent
// source: https://github.com/SlimKQL/Hunting-Queries-Detection-Rules/blob/9c838dc165ac602c525321c6f475e5c90f2fd7d2/DefenderXDR/Detecting%20M365%20Copilot%20Shared%20Agent.kql
